==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Pikachu|65}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Pikachu}}.
*'''Static Shock''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Secret Wonders|Mareep|94}} from the {{TCG|Secret Wonders}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

